# confronted — a witness who came for you blocks every act but the few that answer them
#
# A crime on the Test Roof fails within earshot of the hall, and the brewer comes up to look. He came
# because of you, so he confronts you: he is on the map as somebody who has just walked in, the way
# out reads RUNAWAY, and you cannot walk away — nothing in another area answers. What stands on the
# roof with you may still be looked at and thought about; it is on the click that a lawful act which
# does not answer him (contemplating him) is refused, before any roll — the witness-side twin of an
# enemy in the room. Walking off to the next area used to end it for the price of one move.
#
# --doubt low: one try, no iterative thinking — a retry would step around the refusal this script is
# about (see thinking_iterates.cli and thinking_click_rules_not_retried.cli for the retries).
# --organs encephalon=2: a look, a thought, a failed act and a second thought are more points than
# the seed's own pool holds.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-item knife --grant-mm brute_force --means-only brute_force --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Roof" --period noon --observe-only "goat" --doubt low --organs encephalon=2

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy fail-dice
goal slay
advance 12 180

click observe "goat"
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
click think "goat"
choose ripelore
advance 12 180
regions

click tool 0
regions
choose 0
advance 12 180
regions
click act 1
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect-outcome npc_drawn_in

# The result closed, the brewer stands on the roof, observed by nobody and confronting.
click continue
advance 12 180
expect-state where confronted=CameForYou:brewer exit=RUNAWAY
expect-state trees the brewer

# He holds me where I stand, and no more than that: the views from the roof and the wall on its
# line may still be looked at, while nothing in another area answers and no card can be walked to.
inspect symbols
expect-state symbols click observe thing in Test Roof x5
expect-no-state symbols click observe thing in Test Roof x5 (disabled)
expect-state symbols click observe Test Wall in Test Roof (way)
expect-no-state symbols click observe Test Wall in Test Roof (way) (disabled)
expect-state symbols click observe thing in Test Yard x6 (disabled)
expect-state symbols click observe Test Door in Test Yard (way) (disabled)

# He does. Now try something lawful about him.
goal contemplate
click think "brewer"
choose ripelore
advance 12 180
regions

click act contemplate
advance 12 180
expect-state texts "watching me"
expect-no-outcome dialogue_trigger
quit
